This package contains a bounded WebAssembly compression and encoding
transform module built from the following permissively licensed crates.io
dependencies:

- flate2 1.1.10 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — gzip/zlib/deflate via miniz_oxide
- miniz_oxide 0.9.1 (MIT OR Zlib OR Apache-2.0) — pure-Rust DEFLATE
- adler2 2.0.1 (0BSD OR MIT OR Apache-2.0) — Adler-32 checksum
- brotli 8.0.4 (BSD-3-Clause AND MIT) — Brotli compression and decompression
- brotli-decompressor 5.0.3 (BSD-3-Clause/MIT) — Brotli decoder
- alloc-no-stdlib 2.0.4, alloc-stdlib 0.2.4 (BSD-3-Clause) — Brotli allocators
- lz4_flex 0.14.0 (MIT) — LZ4 frame and block codec
- twox-hash 2.1.4 (MIT) — xxHash for LZ4 frame checksums
- bzip2-rs 0.1.2 (MIT/Apache-2.0) — pure-Rust bzip2 decoder (decode only)
- lzma-rs 0.3.0 (MIT) — LZMA, LZMA2, and xz streams
- byteorder 1.5.0 (Unlicense OR MIT) — endian reads for lzma-rs
- crc 3.4.0, crc-catalog 2.5.0 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — xz CRC checks
- ruzstd 0.9.0 (MIT) — pure-Rust Zstandard decoder (decode only)
- data-encoding 2.11.1 (MIT) — hex/base64/base32 families
- bs58 0.5.1 (MIT/Apache-2.0) — Base58 and Base58Check
- serde 1.0.229, serde_json 1.0.145 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — JSON envelopes
- wasm-bindgen 0.2.108 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — JavaScript bindings

Notable transitive crates: crc32fast, itoa, memchr, ryu, tinyvec
(MIT OR Apache-2.0, Zlib, or Unlicense). The full dependency closure is
recorded in Cargo.lock; every entry is permissively licensed. No GPL,
LGPL, or proprietary code is linked into the module.
